WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.554
Clerk: What do you have?

2
00:00:04.555 --> 00:00:06.197
Sue: I have plates.

3
00:00:06.198 --> 00:00:08.936
What do you have, Alex? Alex:

4
00:00:08.937 --> 00:00:13.993
I have napkins.

5
00:00:13.994 --> 00:00:16.026
Sue: What does Maxie have?

6
00:00:16.027 --> 00:00:18.137
Taco: She has ice cream.

7
00:00:18.138 --> 00:00:19.932
Maxie: Hurry up, Sue!

8
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:26.037
Taco: Let's go!

9
00:00:26.038 --> 00:00:29.176
Mrs. Black is a witch! Sue:

10
00:00:29.177 --> 00:00:31.839
Don't be silly, Taco. Alex:

11
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:38.079
Mrs. Black is not a witch.

12
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:41.804
Clerk: Excuse me, what do you have?

13
00:00:41.805 --> 00:00:48.639
Man: I have frogs! Ha-ha-ha!

